	(text "BugBot Final - Motion Board (power and drive), root sheet\nRespin 2026-09-04: no MCU. Charger, soft switch, 3V3 buck-boost for both boards,\nfour I2C motor drivers; USB passes through to the Vision board's ESP32-P4.\nConnectors and mounting holes live here; power links are drawn, the rest joins by label." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 30 0)
